; Exercise 3: the list with the integral sign, "an adjective, followed by
; any number of adjectives", as a loop. The loop ends with the flag false,
; at the first word that is not an adjective; FLAG sets it again.
;
;   <list> ::= <adj> J{ <adj> }

        CALL    PHRASE
        STOP
PHRASE  CALL    LIST
        FALSE   P9
        CALL    NOUN
P9      RETURN
LIST    CALL    ADJ
        FALSE   L9
L1      CALL    ADJ
        TRUE    L1
        FLAG
L9      RETURN
ADJ     MATCH   BIG
        TRUE    A9
        MATCH   BAD
A9      RETURN
NOUN    MATCH   BEAR
        RETURN
